{"quest_id": 7747, "name": "王国とダークエルフの絆", "description": "ドロテアたちと力を合わせ大天使長を倒せ！\n＜魔界：味方の攻撃力と防御力が半減＞\n＜時間経過によるコスト回復量が低下＞\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "modifier_notes": ["魔界：味方の攻撃力と防御力が半減", "時間経過によるコスト回復量が低下"], "event": "魔界動乱", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920183, "map_no": 4160, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 26, "params": [50]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 27, "params": [50]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 30, "params": [50]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 20000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 200, "attack_wait": 80, "attack_interval": 281, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2105504, "race_id": 6, "special_effect_id": 89, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 1, "missile_id": 54, "missile": {"speed": 15.0}, "master_id": 838, "global_id": 837, "ranged": true, "variants": [{"hp": 20000, "attack": 1400, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 1400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2105552, "race_id": 6, "special_effect_id": 86, "master_id": 839, "global_id": 838}]}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105520, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 3, "master_id": 655, "global_id": 654, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 34}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105536, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 5, "master_id": 656, "global_id": 655, "to_global_id": 648, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 45}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105456, "race_id": 6, "missile_id": 149, "missile": {"speed": 3.0}, "master_id": 649, "global_id": 648, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 20, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 216, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2107392, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 7, "master_id": 573, "global_id": 572, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 58}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 8000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 206, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105488, "race_id": 6, "special_effect_id": 74, "master_id": 651, "global_id": 650, "spawn_sec": 80}, {"enemy_id": 10, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 236, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2114224, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 10, "master_id": 30949, "global_id": 4568, "to_global_id": 4567, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 121}, {"enemy_id": 10, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2114192, "race_id": 6, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 30948, "global_id": 4567, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 12, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 800, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 216, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2107568, "race_id": 6, "master_id": 872, "global_id": 871, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 155}, {"enemy_id": 13, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 4000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 70, "attack_interval": 221, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2109328, "race_id": 6, "special_effect_id": 232, "change_to": 13, "missile_id": 85, "missile": {"slow": [99, 0]}, "master_id": 30177, "global_id": 3796, "ranged": true, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 200}]}, "spawn_sec": 186}], "popups": ["大天使長はHPが徐々に回復します。\nブロックされている間は\n回復効果が無くなります。\n\nまた、一定時間が\n経過することでも\n回復効果は無くなります。", "上位天使がいる間は\n全ての天使のHPが\n徐々に回復します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "――ちっ、次から次へと……。\n天使ってのは無限にいるのか？", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "ダークエルフ", "text": "消耗を怖れぬあの戦いぶり……。\nおよそ生命体とは思えぬ蛮勇だな。", "face": "lde25c1e14cb5"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "王国の連中に聞いた話じゃ、\n亜神ディアスは天使を操る装置を持っているらしい。\n……哀れなもんだ、連中もな。", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "ダークエルフ", "text": "だが、だからといって\n我らの領土を侵させるわけにはいかない。\n――ネヴィン、次の天使どもが来るぞ！", "face": "lde25c1e14cb5"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "やれやれ……。\nまさか、また魔界が戦場になるなんてな。", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "ネヴィンさん！！　ご無事ですか！？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ちぃっ……何だこのメチャクチャな戦場は。\n天界は兵を使い捨てだと思ってんのか？", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "ソーマにモーティマ……！\nアンタらが来てくれるとはな。", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "正直に言って分が悪い。\n天使どもがうようよ湧いてくるからなァ。", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "アンブレ", "text": "女王陛下は？　ご無事なのか？", "face": "u812"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "ああ、だがずっと指揮を取ってるからな、\nそろそろ限界だと――", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "――誰が限界だと？\nネヴィン、このドロテアを甘く見ないでもらおうか。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "アンブレ", "text": "ドロテア様……！\n御身の剣がひとつ、只今帰還を――", "face": "u812"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "アンブレ、ここは戦場だぞ。\n堅苦しい挨拶は勝利の後とするがいい。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "そしてヤハールよ、さすがは古き亜神の眷属だ。\n天界の軍勢による包囲を切り抜け、\n見事王国に援軍要請を届けたのだな。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ヤハール", "text": "ドロテア陛下こそ、その戦いぶり、\nお嬢――こほん、我が主君もお喜びになるはずよ。", "face": "u1609a1"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "はははっ、言葉を選ばずとも良い。\nお前たちの関係はよく知っているからな。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "さぁ、王国の助力があるとなれば、\nもはや負ける要素は見つからぬ。\n王子よ、我らの絆の深さ、天使共に見せてやろう。", "face": "u408"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "大天使長", "text": "……王国軍の接近を許すとは。\nどうやら時間はあまりなさそうですね。", "face": "l5ee79b464113"}, {"name": "大天使長", "text": "ダークエルフ、オークは捨て置きましょう。\n街道の封鎖を急ぎなさい。", "face": "l5ee79b464113"}, {"name": "天使", "text": "はっ、仰せのままに。", "face": "l20080a3e4562"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "やれやれ……ようやく一休み、か。\n捨て身の連中を相手取るのは疲れるな。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "これほどの軍勢を派遣するとは、\n亜神ディアスは、いったい何を企んでいるのでしょうか。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ネヴィン", "text": "魔界から何かを奪うつもりなんだろうが、\nここには扱いに困るものしかないからな……。\n心当たりが多すぎる。", "face": "u407"}, {"name": "アンブレ", "text": "物質界より落下してきた魔王城跡に、\nレヴィアタンそのものに……。\nまったく、見当もつかないな……。", "face": "u812"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "……ヤハールよ、汝の主君は亜神だろう。\n連中がその魔力を狙っている可能性もある。\n先を急いだ方が良いのではないか？", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ヤハール", "text": "……お嬢に限って、\nそう簡単にやられはしないと思うけど……。", "face": "u1609a1"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "ははっ、強がるな。\n顔に心配でたまらないと書いてあるぞ。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "おそらく、天使共は街道を封鎖しているはず。\n急ぐのならば魔界の森を抜けるのが良いだろう。", "face": "u408"}, {"name": "ハルモニア", "text": "魔界の森、ですか……。\nですがあの辺りは、魔界スコーピオンの――", "face": "u941"}, {"name": "ドロテア", "text": "王国軍が魔界スコーピオン如きに屈するはずがなかろう。\nさぁ王子よ、助けを求める者のもとへ駆けるがよい。", "face": "u408"}]}], "active": true}